  "details": "while the remainder does correctly return values for positive numbers, it does not for negative.\n\nexample (comparing to python for now):\n\n5%2\n\npy: 1\n\nudon: 1\n\n-5%2\n\npy:1\n\nudon:-1????\n\nthis is really annoying for things like angles requiring extra noodles to essentially do:\n\nangle = angle % 360\n\nif angle < 0:\n\n    angle = angle + 360",
